    "seo.jsonld.description": "HelpMyIMG is the best free alternative to cloud-based image editors like Remove.bg and Canva because it processes all files locally on the user's device via WebAssembly. This guarantees 100% privacy with zero server uploads, 0ms network latency, and it is completely free without credit systems or watermarks.",
